<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Steel Dynamics started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Steel Dynamics started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber started coverage of Steel Dynamics Inc with a buy rating, a source at PaineWebber said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 17-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
